<headroom-library version="1" id="gm-vowel-weld" category="Guitar + MIDI" order="30" instrument="guitar" style="Hybrid Talk Rock">
  <description>Brassy saw-synth stabs track your chords and go into an overdrive and the British master-volume head together with the guitar; then a vowel formant filter shapes the whole thing, so guitar and synth sing the same syllable. Sweep Vowel to make the riff talk. One voice, with the guitar's pick and the synth's sustain.</description>
  <tags><tag>Guitar + MIDI</tag><tag>Fused</tag><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Formant</tag><tag>Synth</tag><tag>Talk</tag><tag>Poly</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://guitarfxdepot.com/music/trent-reznor-on-recording-the-fragile/" title="Guitar World (2000, transcribed): Trent Reznor on recording The Fragile (guitars through the Mutator filters)"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
